    "body": "Sorry, I meant that Chrome creates new function wrappers for same-origin cross-window access for cross-origin accessible IDL operations.  When you access a cross-origin accessible IDL operation, Chrome returns a function wrapper created in the Current realm.  Chrome creates a function wrapper per realm and re-uses it in the same realm.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
